        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Spiff\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/48/1865_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Spiff:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just to give the feedback, the pages are all working for me on my iPad, but they aren't properly constrained width-wise, meaning that need to manually shrink the page or scroll to the right to view the page's full width. I'm sure that's something that' seeing worked on right now.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>\\Ditto. On mobile it looks like I'm viewing a desktop site.</p>",
